WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.042
Pick the smallest change that addresses the specific friction you are testing.

00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:10.792
Check the path on mobile, verify the tracking fires once, and write down the rollback.

00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:16.208
The fictional shop tries one clearer link: Book a bike repair. It opens the form.

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:20.458
Save the change and its release date. Make sure you can undo it.
